apons and armor or an option for a simplified fishing mode, among others.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly replayable</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the adventure in new ways by trying the wide range of game settings, and discover the different experiences of playing solo and co-op. </p></li></ul></li></ul>", "short_description": "Enjoy Oppidum, a story-driven survival experience for 1-4 players full of adventure, action, crafting, exploration… Everything a squad of scouts would love for a good story to tell. Do you accept the challenge?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/c8cd32f5d401f19b977dc6beb1ca7962b822687b/header.jpg?t=1773228043", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/e1c61bbbbb5ebb6d206b4ea1e339616d9997019f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773228043", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/e1c61bbbbb5ebb6d206b4ea1e339616d9997019f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773228043", "website": "http://playoppidum.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3225 or Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960 or Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p@30 fps on Low settings</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>